<title>UK: Dana Petroleum to raise 30 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Dana Petroleum to raise 30 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dana Petroleum said on Wednesday that it was issuing 139.78 million shares at 21.5 pence each to raise about 30 million stg, before expenses.</p>
<p>The funds would be used to acquire 40 percent in Yogan-neft, 20 percent in Yuganskoil and five percent in Evikhon.</p>
</text>
